error[E0301]: `==` on `P` needs the trait `Eq`, and nothing named `Eq` is in scope
 --> mem:///main.lu:7:8
  |
7 |     if a == b { 0 } else { 1 }
  |        ^ this is `P`, not a primitive
  |
  = note: an operator on a user type dispatches through its trait ([type.trait.op]): `==` is
    `Eq.eq`. Bring `Eq` into scope (std.ops and std.cmp declare the operator traits) and
    write `impl Eq for P`.
